                                    "🆘 Trapped guidance" to "I am locked in a closed space what do I do?"
                                ) else listOf(
                                    "🛒 Search tomatoes" to "Search for organic tomatoes in Crowmix Noida store.",
                                    "💻 Write algorithm" to "Write a fast Dijkstra routing system in Kotlin.",
                                    "📦 Order status" to "What is the status of my live quick-commerce checkout?"
